# playpick cell: mode=daily boss=crowns (coverage label only -- daily.boss is
# not a real playpick axis, see direction.md #1's driver-lesson note)
# spec=priest:shadow style=dodge view=1280x800 save=carried.
#
# Probe (2026-09-30-2-probe.play) found today's actual daily is The
# Bloodgorged, 25-player normal, FALTERING (healing lands for a quarter
# less). class:6 = "Priest DPS" on the daily grid, which is priest's only
# damage spec (shadow) -- first priest:shadow daily on record and the first
# time `dodge` has met this boss/size/difficulty/affix combination.
#
# Also the first daily+carried session to check something past the pull
# itself: direction.md #5 says a `carried` save never survives a *second*
# separate `playbot` invocation (different pid -> different port -> different
# localStorage origin, filed as #273) but no session has yet checked whether
# "no attempt yet today" on the daily screen updates *within* one script, on
# the same Page, right after a real attempt completes. That isolates a
# same-session display bug from the already-filed cross-invocation one if it
# turns up.
open
tap daily
targets
tap class:6
targets
shot class-picked
tap start
waitscreen fight 15
state
shot start

play dodge 90
state
shot mid1
bill

play dodge 90
state
shot mid2
bill

play dodge 90
state
shot mid3
bill

play dodge 60
state
shot end
bill
says

key escape
targets
shot after-escape
